          "docs": "Retrieve sales analytics data from the UNFI Insights dashboard. Provides comprehensive sales, inventory, and deduction data across UNFI's entire network spanning both natural (west) and conventional (east) distribution channels."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Fill Rate Data",
